      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. I'm a little worried it might sound a bit too cold or generic though. Could you try adding a sentence or two that acknowledges his specific strengths in backend development more directly? I want him to feel like we actually valued his time and skill, even if it didn't work out this time.",
